  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "'BLUE MOUNTAIN BEAUTY' BLUE MOUNTAIN BEACH CONDOS UNIT #413<br><br>Sit back & relax in this first class GULF FRONT unit tucked away in a private building in beautiful Blue Mountain Beach. It does not get any closer to the beach than this! <br><br>The 1600sf condo has an open floor plan that provides for lots of space to be together with family and friends in the combination kitchen/dining/living area. The large sliding glass doors as well as the waterfront windows provide abundant light and magnificent views for all to enjoy.<br><br>The roomy balcony is accessible from both the living area and the master bedroom. Your forth floor views of the emerald coast are simply spectacular from this balcony. You can also enjoy the outdoor dining and bistro table. <br><br>*BEDROOMS & BATHROOMS: <br>Primary Bedroom: King, Gulf Front, Shower + Tub + 2 Vanities<br>Guest Bedroom: Queen, Shower/Tub Combo (has hall access also)<br>Guest Bedroom: 2 Doubles, Shower/Tub Combo<br><br>*AREA INFORMATION:<br>Located off of Scenic Highway 30-A in Walton County, Florida, it's minutes from the Fort Walton and Panama City Beach Airports but worlds away from the crowds. Our building is tucked off of the south side of 30A in the quaint 'town' of Blue Mountain Beach. 30A is a two lane road that hugs the coastline of one of the world's most beautiful white sand beaches. We are between Destin and Panama City Beach (20-25 min to each), 15 minutes from Sandestin, 5 minutes from Seaside, Watercolor and Grayton Beach. There is an 18-mile bike path, a state park, many top-notch local restaurants, art galleries, boutiques, gourmet food and wine stores and a Publix supermarket just a few miles away.<br><br>*AMENITIES: <br><br>-PRIVATE BEACH <br><br>-Free Beach Setup (2 chairs + 1 umbrella) March 1- October 31, sign up online! Service also offers kayaks, paddle boards & bonfires. Beach <br><br>-Gulf Front Pool (heated in colder months) & Hot Tub <br><br>-Fitness Room<br><br>-Community Grilling Area <br><br>-Basketball Court<br><br>-Industrial Ice Machine in Parking Garage <br><br>-Starter package with hand soap, body soap, conditioning shampoo, toilet paper, paper towels, dish tabs, laundry tabs, coffee pods + trash bags! <br><br>-High Speed Wireless Internet throughout the unit & building, Smart TVs with streaming + Direct TV <br><br>-Gated/keypad secured building with on site security service provided during high season<br><br>-All units open into large atrium with sitting areas to relax or get work done <br><br>-covered parking garage for 1 vehicle + additional parking in overflow lot, golf <br> carts are permitted on property and treated as one of your vehicles <br><br>-concierge services available <br><br>-MANAGEMENT: All of our 'Prime South Beach Properties' at Blue Lupine are managed by Ashley Cappleman our full service LOCAL property manager that is available to assist you in every aspect of your stay with us.<br><br>Please contact Ashley for additional information. If your group is looking to book additional properties within the building please inquire, manager has multiple units aka...Prime South Beach Properties exclusively in the building.<br><br>All guests are required to complete a rental agreement.",
